WEBVTT

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.870
Dammit...

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.490
Damn that Defense Club!

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.450
How have you not realized it?

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:14.910
Realized what?

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.380
Don't play dumb!

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:19.870
We're the ones who have been 
sending monsters after you!

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.620
Don't you get it yet?

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.080
We, the brothers, are...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.670
Galaxy Idols: The VEPPer!

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.020
They've ignored us since New Year...

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.420
that's a month and a half!

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.760
Unforgivable.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.710
We revealed our secret...

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:44.600
we gave them the shock 
of a lifetime, and yet...

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.150
We identified ourselves explicitly,

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:54.530
<b>Grr grr grr grr</b>

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.760
yet they didn't say a 
single word in response...

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.420
Are they mocking us?!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:54.530
What they're doing isn't even mocking us.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:57.440
I think they don't even care about us at all.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.490
Unforgivable!

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.950
<b>Earth Defense Club (lol)</b>

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:01.950
Oh yeah!

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.150
Did you know?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.410
Tomorrow's Valentine's Day!

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.540
Oh, I totally forgot.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:09.670
<b>Oden
Warm and Fluffy!</b>

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.670
But I'm sure Atsushi will 
be giving me something.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.400
Something? You mean chocolate, right?

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.100
Speaking of forgetting things,

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.640
are you sure we shouldn't be doing 
something about the Beppu Brothers?

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.360
Yeah, they were all...

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:24.520
"Galaxy Idol the VEPPer," 
or something, right?

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.440
We've ignored them for a month and a half.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.820
It's a little late to comment on it now.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.030
I'm just glad we know where 
the monsters are coming from!

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.950
Yeah, that's true.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:39.000
That the Beppu Brothers are creating monsters

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.200
is an alarming problem in itself!

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:46.040
Yeah, those two don't really seem 
like the type to just drop it...

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:23.800
The Chemical Substance of Love

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.390
What's with those helicopters?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.730
They seem to be carrying chocolate.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.670
Wow!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.440
They're getting that much chocolate?

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.800
Another year, another 
enormous pile of chocolate.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.480
Eating it all would be fatal.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.660
Finding ways to dispose of it all 
every year is not an easy task.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.350
Galaxy Idols The VEPPer sure are a cut above!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.880
Galaxy Idols?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.790
Yeah, that's what they called themselves!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.660
Bro?

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.840
Oh, Yumoto.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.880
I made chocolate breakfast gruel.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.920
Wow! Great!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.010
Looks delicious!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.630
You should eat it while it's still hot.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.840
It's got barley and rice.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.810
Thanks, Bro!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.940
That's the Gora we know.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.350
Barley chocolate is delicious.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:23.180
That means chocolate barley rice 
gruel must be delicious, too.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:23.860
Dammit!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:24.910
I want it!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.220
If not for Hakone Yumoto...

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.330
Why don't we get rid of him?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.290
They've ignored us for a month and a half...

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:39.310
This time, at last, we'll 
settle things with them.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.160
Yeah!

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.260
Let's beat 'em!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:46.010
Valentine's Day will be the 
day Hakone Yumoto dies.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.430
Io, did you bring any paper bags?

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.810
I'll probably get more by 
the time school's over.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.900
I can't carry it all.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:05:01.000
I thought this might happen, so I 
arranged for a truck to come by.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.520
I'll send you the bill later, of course.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:05.150
That's the Io I know!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.600
Just find a way to get 
me out of the bill, okay?

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.870
I'll give you chocolate!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.370
<b>Io</b>

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:15.090
I'm getting plenty of chocolate from 
the candy companies I own stock in.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.540
But I'll take it, if you're offering.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.750
I wonder if you'll be the one ending 
up with the most chocolate.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.650
This is delicious!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:26.610
Right?

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.640
I tried to cut back on 
the sweetness this year.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.640
<b>Earth Defense Club (lol)</b>

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.810
You mean it just showed up?

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.840
It looks like very expensive wrapping.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.060
Yeah...

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.080
The message is handwritten, too.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.780
Who's it addressed to?

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:48.370
Anyway, why don't we open it?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.660
There might be a letter or something inside!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.690
Are you sure we should be doing this?

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:53.990
I'm sure!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.950
I wanna eat chocolate!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:02.670
What?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.820
So it's to all of us?

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:08.950
The cards are hand-written, and 
the bouquets are all different...

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.940
But there's none for Wom-san.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.140
Yes, that is certainly a shame.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.470
So what do we do with them?

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.980
Not eat them, that's for sure.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.350
We don't even know who it's from.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.100
That's right!

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.580
We've got plenty of other 
stuff to eat anyway.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.300
And nothing is more terrifying than "free."

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.560
But that would be rude to the 
person who gave it to us!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.320
I'm gonna try it!

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.720
Idiot! Don't do that!

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.580
Delicious!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.780
This chocolate is really delicious!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:38.320
But...

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.540
What's wrong, Yumoto?

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:45.280
I bet they're crying about now.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:49.220
They need to learn that life 
isn't all wine and roses.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.220
You do have a good idea 
from time to time, Dadacha.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.930
I'm honored by your compliment!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.060
<b>Dark chocolate</b>

00:06:53.930 --> 00:07:01.150
<b>Endorphins</b>

00:06:54.340 --> 00:07:00.300
Dark chocolate causes the brain to release 
neuropeptides known as endorphins,

00:06:55.680 --> 00:07:01.480
<b>Brain</b>

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.480
which produce feelings of happiness 
and stimulate the mind.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:06.480
At the same time, it also 
raises the heart rate.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:11.100
I've fused that with capsicum extract using 
my highly advanced scientific technology...

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:16.660
If they eat it, they'll end up 
so stimulated and high on joy,

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.420
their combat prowess will be diminshed!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.210
And that's how it works!

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.960
Well, we don't really care about that...

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.070
But this time, we'll crush the Defense Club!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.630
And in the process, rid 
ourselves of Hakone Yumoto!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.870
That super-spicy chocolate will 
be but a minor entertainment

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.760
before we crush Hakone Yumoto.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.850
And we'll drive the rest of the Battle 
Lovers to destruction in the process.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:38.820
Yes.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:42.300
We've found a lot of good 
monster candidates this time.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.280
But I feel kind of excited and good!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.170
Time for a cuddlefest!

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.520
And...

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:02.120
I want to cuddle you senpai, too!

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.910
Senpai...

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:05.020
I love you!

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:06.180
No way!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.100
There's something definitely 
weird in that chocolate...

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.240
Anyway, we'd better run.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.090
Good idea!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.050
<b>Earth Defense Club (lol)</b>

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.510
Senpai!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.760
Senpai! Where are you?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.730
En-chan-senpai?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.490
Hey, he singled you out.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:22.980
Found you!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.370
You always act so indifferent,

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.770
but I know you really care 
about us, En-chan-senpai!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.940
I love you for it!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.990
He confessed his love while cuddling him...

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.070
Just hearing it is embarrassing.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.580
Yumoto's got passion.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.680
Yumoto! Atsushi's right there! There!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:39.680
En-chan!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:40.410
Selling out his friend?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.620
Yeah! Atsushi-senpai!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.090
Hey, Yumoto, calm down!

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:47.710
Atsushi-senpai, I think you're the 
reason the Defense Club exists!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:52.100
You're like a mom, but I think you 
secretly have a dark side, too!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:53.840
I love that about you!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.400
Stop it!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.700
Well, that sucked.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.120
You know, Senpai, you sold 
out your best friend.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:01.300
Atsushi would have done the same thing.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.690
I can't deny it.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:04.320
Yumoto, that's enough.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.970
Look. Ryuu's right there!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:06.910
Are you kidding me?!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.600
Ryuu-senpai...

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.310
I'm outta here!

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:12.720
You say you love girls,

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:16.780
but I know you treasure us most of all.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.990
And I love you too, Ryuu-senpai!

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.330
Cut it out!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:24.080
Is it just my imagination, 
or is Ryuu enjoying this?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.710
I can't look directly at it.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.480
But you're up next, Io.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.360
Io-senpai!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.920
No, I believe I'll pass!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.880
Io-senpai, I know you value money,

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:39.890
but you value the love we 
share the most! I love you!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.880
I-I get it! So please, stop it!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:44.340
Io's not used to that kind of thing.

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:46.100
Yeah, he's red as a beet.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.100
What are we gonna do about this?

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:49.860
I just investigated,

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.990
and those chocolates

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:55.260
have the chemical substance 
 capsicum inside them!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.910
We just have to wait for 
his excitement to wear off!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.990
So when will it wear off?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.950
I'm afraid I don't know...

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:07.870
Come on, let's have another cuddle party!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.840
Senpai, wait for me!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.040
It's all going as planned, I see.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.960
How are you feeling, Hakone Yumoto?

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.260
Amazing, right?

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.510
Yeah, just amazing!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:22.840
He's stupid.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:23.950
He's far too stupid.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:27.430
How could someone like him 
get Gora-san all to himself?

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:32.080
Does that mean you're the guys who 
sent us those weird chocolates?

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.500
Yeah, that's right!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.890
Because you're in our way, to be honest!

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:39.910
How dare you ignore our declaration 
of war for a month and a half!

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:43.160
Today, at last, we're going to eliminate you!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.060
From the universe itself!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:53.630
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
racing through the galaxy!</i>

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.300
What the heck?

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.630
What's with this song?

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.340
<i>Let's illuminate the mysteries 
of the universe...</i>

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.470
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:13.830
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
racing through the galaxy!</i>

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:17.150
<i>Let's illuminate the mysteries 
of the universe...</i>

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.120
The twin stars shining in the heavens!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.240
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.190
Salty Sol!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.110
Melty Luna!

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.900
Galaxy Idols, the VEPPer!

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:29.720
Let me be frank.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.620
We find you unacceptable as 
rivals for idols like us.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.040
In other words, we hate your guts!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:36.090
In particular...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.790
Hakone Yumoto!

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:38.620
Huh?

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.800
What was that?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.070
If not for you...

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.760
...he would be ours...

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:48.190
Knowing that you're idols like us

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.130
really gets under our skin!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.980
Huh? Idols like you?

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.920
Hakone Yumoto.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.280
You must disappear from this 
world... from this universe!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.800
That goes for all of you!

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.700
Let's go, Battle Lovers!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.510
It's time for an idol showdown!

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:07.240
Hey, they're talking about idols again.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.910
What does that even mean?

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.990
Well, I'm an idol, at least...

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.670
I can say with confidence 
that I am <i>not</i> an idol.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.090
But what we do know

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.140
is that the VEPPer are the 
ones sending the monsters!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:22.130
We should probably fight...

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.770
Sure, but it doesn't seem like 
they're trying to destroy Earth

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:28.600
or humanity like the 
Conquest Club from before.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:29.960
I say we ignore them.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.000
Yeah, ignore them.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.690
Agreed.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.310
We're not making any money off it, so...

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.690
Well, so long!

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.250
S-Stop it!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.230
What are you thinking?

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:40.160
Dammit!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.940
Stop that! It feels so good!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.500
I think we'd better send a monster!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.740
First, get us out of here!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.520
Okay! Fluffhugger!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.660
I can't see!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:57.830
<b>Beppu Haruhiko
Born August 21st
Blood Type AB / Leo
Hobbies: Bonsai, Gardening,
 Horseback Riding
Likes: Rice balls</b>

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.920
Listen, you lot.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.260
You're our loyal followers, aren't you?

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:03.720
Yes!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:08.640
And what's more, you've never once 
received chocolate from anyone.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.100
Yes!

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.830
Then show your love for us

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:16.980
by turning those years of resentment 
into hatred for the Battle Lovers!

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.330
They get lots of chocolate!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.860
Possibly even more than we did!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.180
Hate them!

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:28.750
Because our own hatred 
of them is irrepressible!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.830
Yes!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.660
We and our apes are as one!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.460
Then let us...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.790
...grant your wish!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:45.440
<i>Lucky you!</i>

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.260
<i>Open your eyes!</i>

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.850
<i>Happy you!</i>

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.850
<i>Open them wide!</i>

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.860
<i>You won't want to miss it...</i>

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:58.520
<i>The big bang of love, dreams, and light!</i>

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:06.010
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
blooming in the galaxy!</i>

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:09.460
<i>Moon and sun, miracles and secrets</i>

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.450
The twin stars shining in the heavens!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.450
Salty Sol!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.370
<i>We're the stars making wishes come true!</i>

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.370
Melty Luna!

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:19.120
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
racing through the galaxy!</i>

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.710
Galaxy Idols, the VEPPer!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.120
Chosen warriors!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:22.620
<i>Let's illuminate the mysteries 
of the universe...</i>

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.080
Lucky you!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.040
Happy you!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.710
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.010
Shooting...

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:26.420
Star!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:38.970
Now we just have to send them to bust 
up that perverted Hakone Yumoto...

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:41.600
and the rest of the Defense Club.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.770
We'll bury them in chocolate.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.610
Eat too much chocolate 
and suffer the cavities,

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.450
Hakone Yumoto and allies!

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.030
Senpai!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.410
I wanna cuddle more!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.870
The True Lovracelet...

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.850
I guess a monster must have appeared.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.520
At a time like this?

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.820
And we can't even handle Yumoto...

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:09.300
Is it even okay for Yumoto to 
transform in the state he's in?

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.900
Regardless, everyone!

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.760
Let's Love Making!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.340
Love Making!

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:42.670
The Sparkling Prince!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.960
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.300
Love Making.

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:58.640
The Flashing Prince!

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.660
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.410
Love Making.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.000
The Piercing Prince!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.330
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.840
Love Making.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.000
The Roaring Prince!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.020
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:32.690
Love Making!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.390
The Thrilling Prince!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.840
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.260
This love-filled planet

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:51.190
will not abide those who lack love!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.180
Those who wield loveless power

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.900
must kneel before love!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.440
Love is power!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.120
Love is hope!

00:16:58.350 --> 00:16:59.790
Be born for love!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.580
Give your life for love!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.750
Love!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.750
We are, forever, the heirs 
to the throne of love...

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.000
Battle Lovers!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.820
Feel the power...

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.650
of love!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.300
This is our final battle!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.850
Get ready, Battle Lovers!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:19.170
And Hakone Yumoto!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:22.950
Looks like they have a 
particular hatred of Yumoto.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:24.420
This is so annoying.

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:26.630
Can't we just run away?

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:27.450
Yeah.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.150
I don't see any reason why we should fight...

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.520
I've got preparations to make 
for my Valentine's dates.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:36.360
I'm interested in checking the 
stocks for my candy companies.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.900
No!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.830
We can't just let the 
monsters stay like that!

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.040
I'm gonna save them all 
with the power of our love!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:45.140
Oh, hell.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.520
Yumoto's getting into it.

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:49.000
How about we just let him 
take point this time?

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.340
I'm in!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.420
No objections here.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.940
But, everyone!

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:53.880
You're not going to fight?

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.220
I have no reason to fight.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.620
This whole idol showdown thing is beyond me.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:17:59.660
Okay!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:03.230
Everyone who wants a cuddle, gather 'round!

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.010
What the heck?

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:06.350
I'm sure he has a plan!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.810
Hey! Come here!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.520
Gather 'round!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.850
Come on!

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:14.980
My wellspring of love never stops gushing!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.900
Is it okay to let this happen?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.490
There are quite a lot of monsters...

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.640
Looks like trouble.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.560
It would be hard to take them all alone...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.430
Okay, let's get going!

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:29.080
A drop of love for each of you!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:30.760
A new technique?

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.740
Yumoto's got a real flair for the dramatic.

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:34.020
I can't watch.

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.300
I wonder where he learned that.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.630
Go flying, Love Sprinkle!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.670
Yep, it's a new technique.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:45.970
Even I never expected a technique like this!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.940
What is this feeling?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.590
Strange but enjoyable!

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:57.190
I don't know what it is, 
but it makes me happy!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.880
What the hell is that?

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.080
Those love-starved monsters...

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.620
It's like feeling love for the 
first time has addled their minds.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.220
This is a very bad development!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:08.880
Love is good!

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.930
It feels so good!

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:15.040
Now everyone, wallow in the love!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:15.960
Let's support him!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.860
Let's all support that red angel!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:21.030
<b>LOVE</b>

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.180
Red angel! Cha-cha-cha!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.850
Red angel! Cha-cha-cha!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.240
<b>Wave Your Hands</b>

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:23.960
Red angel?

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.680
I think they mean Yumoto...

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.680
They seem to really love him.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.770
It's a bit creepy, but I can feel it.

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.760
What are they doing?

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.660
Their chants make no sense.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.230
They're idiots, start to finish.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.740
That's enough, Yumoto.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.330
Thanks, everyone!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.330
You're too pleased with yourself.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:40.700
Yumoto!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:43.160
Use the True Love Fountain already!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.120
Okay!

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.150
Everyone, accept my love!

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:50.910
True Love Fountain!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.930
Love is over!

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.500
That kid's pretty cute!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.060
He looks like an idol!

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.920
Haru-chan, Aki-chan!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:18.370
I think it's time you stepped in!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.780
Yes.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.740
I can't stand to look at this 
disgusting sight anymore.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.700
Hakone Yumoto really is unforgivable!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:26.840
Hey!

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.550
It's not over yet!

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.160
We're going to fight you!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.620
But I don't wanna fight!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.790
I wanna cuddle with you again, VEPPer-san!

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:37.630
Silence!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.340
Unlucky you!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.050
Unhappy you!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.110
Take our resentment...

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.880
...and be grateful to get it!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.510
Deadly...

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.330
Cuddle!

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:52.860
This is so humiliating!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.640
Shut up! Stop it!

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.340
I can't take it, Haru!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:57.120
Let's pull back for now!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:59.000
Yeah, I can't take it!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:01.040
But wait!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.530
They left.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.480
Okay, Senpai!

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.640
Please let me cuddle you!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:15.880
It's no use.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.060
Isn't there any way to snap him out of it?

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.800
Let's take him to the bath! The bath!

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.500
That's a fine idea!

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.350
Come on, Yumoto!

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:25.880
What's going on!?

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:33.100
I wanna cuddle more...

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.540
What's wrong, Yumoto?!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.920
Sir, Yumoto's been acting strangely

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:40.060
since he ate some chocolate 
the Beppu Brothers gave him.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.270
What?!

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:49.630
Be strong, Yumoto!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.030
Snap out of it!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.070
Huh?

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:54.630
Why am I in the bath with you, bro?

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:56.660
You're all right now.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:57.780
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:58.420
Huh?

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:02.240
As always, Gora-san brings 
the serious brotherly love.

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:04.860
But what's up with those Beppu Brothers?

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:06.880
They were firing off some kind 
of move or something, right?

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:11.940
They gave themselves that weird name, too.

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.850
I guess there's more to 
them that meets the eye.

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:16.310
Galaxy Idols, the VEPPer...

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:20.940
We cannot ignore them!

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:58.720
Next Time

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:58.720
Days of Love and Acclaim

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:57.060
Next time: "Days of Love 
and Acclaim!"

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:58.340
Love Making!
